# Upstream Horvath headers are out of scope — the cppcheck analog of
# .clang-tidy's HeaderFilterRegex. cppcheck follows #includes, so without these
# the integration tests (which pull in All.h) would report pre-existing findings
# in upstream code. We lint only the rewritten FftwWrapper.h and the fork's own
# test sources; FftwWrapper.h is deliberately NOT listed here.
